 "notes": "3DGS rows are the authors' re-implementation (same 1600-px loader). Size MB = 1e6 bytes of the bitstream directory (official csv Size [Bytes]). Method per-scene rows = highest rate point. Averages of the method at the 6 rate points in App. Tab. A.1-A.4. Official render.py evaluates the decoded bitstream (Scene.__init__ -> gaussians.decode; fp16 xyz, 8-bit opacity), matching our ss-eval of the decoded model; density evaluate='official' is a diagnostic undecoded mode (fp32 xyz, unquantised opacity) that no official evaluation mirrors (reviewer's estimate of the fp16-position/8-bit-opacity effect vs the undecoded model: 0.01-0.05 dB)."
